    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with his consent. He named a health care agent, and a health care proxy form was completed; the agent is recorded in the chart and is not named here. He said that what matters most to him is staying active, keeping up his appearances and charitable work, and being told plainly about his health so he can take part in every decision. The discussion covered how Parkinson&apos;s disease can change over many years and why his wishes should be revisited as it does. He chose not to record specific treatment preferences today. The plan will be revisited yearly and at any change in stage. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
